                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: Is it possible to watch every episode of Ugly Betty within a week?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- Ugly Betty has 4 seasons with a total of 85 episodes.\n- Each episode is approximately 45 minutes long.\n- To calculate the total time needed to watch every episode, we can multiply the number of episodes by the length of each episode: 85 x 45 = 3,825 minutes.\n- There are 60 minutes in an hour, so we can convert the total minutes to hours: 3,825 / 60 = 63.75 hours.\n- A week has 7 days, which is equivalent to 168 hours.\n- Therefore, it is possible to watch every episode of Ugly Betty within a week, as 63.75 hours is less than 168 hours.\n\nAnswer: A) True",
